@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Publication collaboration: alt, opt and loop
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

actor Client
participant Handler as H
participant "Guarded local store" as S
Client -> H : publish(explicit intent, command identity)
H -> H : validate shape and confirmation
alt invalid
 H --> Client : safe invalid result
else valid
 H -> S : guarded transaction: current authority, lifecycle, identity
 alt denied / identity mismatch / stale version
  S --> H : refused; no publication mutation
 else recorded same-intent outcome
  S --> H : currently permitted recorded projection
 else new eligible intent
  loop each selected snapshot field
   S -> S : validate and copy exact confirmed content
  end
  S -> S : commit revision + live pointer + command result
  S --> H : actual result if observed; response may be lost
 end
 opt commit response observation lost
  H -> S : reconcile same identity; never fresh publication intent
  S --> H : actual known result or unresolved
 end
 H --> Client : truthful permitted outcome
end

@enduml
